  niIntro: { zh: '世界会根据你的身份、经历和关系主动提供合理的接触；你拒绝后不会再被拉入。', en: 'The world reaches out to you from your identity, history and connections; once you decline something, it stops pulling you in.' },
  niNoProfile: { zh: '新对话的第一回合会读取你的 Persona。', en: 'Your Persona is read at the first turn of a new chat.' },
  niOff: { zh: '此对话在 1.4.0 之前绑定，未启用叙事融入（世界主动反应）。', en: 'This chat was bound before 1.4.0; narrative integration is not part of it.' },
  niSource: { zh: '读取自 Persona 描述（{n} 字，第 {rev} 版），包括 Persona Library 已启用的额外分类。', en: 'Read from the Persona description ({n} characters, revision {rev}), including enabled Persona Library sections.' },
  niSourceCore: { zh: '读取自 Persona Library 的主描述（{n} 字，第 {rev} 版），额外分类已忽略。', en: 'Read from the Persona Library core text ({n} characters, revision {rev}); Additional Sections ignored.' },
  secPersona: { zh: 'Persona', en: 'Persona' },
  ignorePersonaSections: { zh: 'Canon 忽略 Persona Library 的额外分类', en: 'Canon ignores Persona Library sections' },
  niJobsToggle: { zh: '小任务（空闲日由世界派给你的小任务）', en: 'Small jobs (offered by the world on free days)' },
  quietDayJobs: { zh: '没有原作事件的日子，世界主动给你派小任务', en: 'On days without canon events, the world offers you small jobs' },
  quietDayJobsTip: { zh: '严格判定的空闲日：这一整天（0:00–23:59）没有任何原作事件（开始、结束、贯穿当天或进行中的都算），且当前时间在 6:00–18:00 之间时，「世界如何接触你」会按你的背景准备一件小任务——比如你所属组织的联络人派来的活：收拾一个小帮派、取送东西、护送、侦查。\n小任务不改动历史：目标和地点是小角色或新出现的，不碰原作事件和有名有姓的原作角色的状态；登场的已有角色要符合他们当时的状态和行踪。接不接由你决定。\n任务须在当天 20:00 前结束，过时作废。它只是可选的：GM 只在自然的停顿或换场时引入，不会打断正在进行的场景。不会额外调用模型（在同一次分析里完成）。', en: 'On a strictly free day — no canon event touches the whole day (starting, ending, running through it or under way) — and between 6:00 and 18:00, the world-reaction step prepares a small job that fits your background — e.g. work from your organization\'s contact: dealing with a minor gang, a delivery, an escort, scouting.\nSmall jobs change no history: targets and places are minor or new, never canon events or the status of named canon characters; existing characters appear only as fits their current state and whereabouts. Taking it is your choice.\nThe job must be over by 20:00 that day. It is optional: the GM brings it in only at a natural pause or change of scene, never interrupting one. No extra model call (same analysis).' },
  ignorePersonaSectionsTip: { zh: '勾选后，Canon 只读 Persona Library 的主描述（core），不读额外分类（Additional Sections）。GM 照常收到全部内容。\n适合放 Canon 用不到的东西（咏唱词、文风说明等）。能力、物品、身份放在额外分类里的话，Canon 就不知道了——发现缺了什么，取消勾选即可。\n只影响之后的读取：已开始的对话要用叙事融入页的「更新本局身份」重读。若在 SillyTavern 自带面板改过 Persona，主描述对不上，Canon 会改读完整描述。', en: 'When ticked, Canon reads only the Persona Library core text, not its Additional Sections. The GM still gets everything.\nGood for things Canon does not need (incantations, style notes). Abilities, items or identity kept in sections are then unknown to Canon — untick if something goes missing.\nAffects later reads only: in a started chat, use "Update this game\'s identity" on the narrative-integration tab. If the Persona was edited in SillyTavern\'s own panel, the core no longer matches and Canon reads the whole description.' },
  niChanged: { zh: '当前 Persona 与本局身份不同。本局保持原身份，直到你选择：', en: 'The active Persona differs from this game\'s player. This game keeps its identity until you choose:' },
  niOld: { zh: '本局身份是旧版插件读的，缺少后来才会读出的内容（如「谁认得你」「角色常态」）。重读一次 Persona 就会补上（调用一次分析模型）。', en: 'This game\'s identity was read by an older version and lacks what later versions read (who recognizes you, your nature). Read the Persona again to add it (one analysis call).' },
  niReread: { zh: '重读 Persona（更新本局身份）', en: 'Read the Persona again (update this game\'s identity)' },
  niRereadTip: { zh: '按当前的 Persona 重新读出本局身份，从当前位置起生效，之前的消息保持原来的身份。调用一次分析模型。', en: 'Reads the current Persona as this game\'s identity from here on; earlier messages keep theirs. One analysis call.' },
  niUpdate: { zh: '更新本局身份（从当前位置起生效）', en: 'Update this game\'s identity (from here on)' },
  niKeep: { zh: '保留本局身份', en: 'Keep this game\'s identity' },
