  wsTitle: { zh: '本局设定', en: 'This game\'s world' },
  wsIntro: { zh: '这一局的世界和原作不同的地方：Persona 里标着 (本局设定) 的行一定会读出来，其余由分析模型从 Persona 里找，你也可以手动添加。Canon 用它们去检索世界书和历史包，命中的条目全部检查；矛盾的条目只在这一局里改写或停用（世界书文件不变），GM 看到的就是改好的条目。', en: 'Where this game\'s world differs from the original: lines of the Persona marked (本局设定) — the marker itself — always, others the analysis finds, and your own. Canon searches the lorebook and the history pack with them and checks every hit; entries that contradict them are rewritten or disabled for this game only (the lorebook files stay as they are), and the GM sees the rewritten entries.' },
  wsRecheck: { zh: '重新检查', en: 'Check again' },
  wsRecheckTip: { zh: '用现在的改动重新检索、检查世界书和历史包（会调用分析模型；没有改动就不调用）。你手动编辑过的条目，只要原文没变就保留。', en: 'Search and check the lorebook and the history pack again with the changes as they are now (analysis calls; none without changes). Entries you edited stay while their original is unchanged.' },
